# Pairs with NoResurrectionAfterClear. The in-flight write then lands on the deleted row and re-creates it.
MODULE: ClearIgnoresGate
TARGET: NoResurrectionAfterClear
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the clear deletes the row while an interleaved write is still in flight
PERTURBS: ClearLeaf

--- FIND
    /\ ~cleared
    /\ gate = "free"
    /\ cleared' = TRUE
--- REPLACE
    /\ ~cleared
    \* MUTATION: the clear does not wait for the persist-write gate
    /\ cleared' = TRUE
--- END
